MID_SE_Kai_Seo_B: <EDH>
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_B_001: Hyah!
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_B_002: Ngh! You've got that impossible strength, but I've got\nsomething too.
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_B_003: How did you parry that?!
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_B_004: RRRAAAH!
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_B_005: Whew! Nice sparring, Theodora!
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_B_006: Think nothing of it. I learn much when I train with\none so skilled.
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_B_007: Hehe. Remember how you sent me flying the first\ntime we met?
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_B_008: I heard Saraminian law says if you block a royal\nperson, you die. Scary to think how close I came.
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_B_009: Hmph. Looking back on it, I acted wisely.
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_B_010: Otherwise, I would have lost a brave warrior in our\nstruggle against the demon god Balor.
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_B_011: I feel good about the fact that we're allies now,\nTheodora.
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_B_012: Sometimes, when I feel like I'm about to crumble, I\nlook over and see you. And I know I'll be OK.
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_B_013: Is this self-doubt I am hearing from you? It is unlike\nyour usual carefree nature.
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_B_014: Hehe. You're right, you're right. I need to be\nmore sure of myself.
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_B_015: You have grown into a fine man.
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_B_016: I always believed that you would, yet it is still\nstriking to see. Your growth is unmistakable.
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_B_019: Really? I'm honored, Theodora.
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_B_020: Guess I can tell everyone you've given me your royal\nseal of approval.
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_B_021: That eagerness is more like the Cai I know.
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_B_022: Let us rest a moment before sparring again. Then we\ncan focus wholly on the match.
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_B_023: Good idea. I'll be ready when you are.
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_B_024: {SetColor=Gray}Hmm... She was just being nice to me there.\nNo question.{SetColor=Default}
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_B_025: {SetColor=Gray}I guess Theodora's got a soft side after all.{SetColor=Default}
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_B_026: {SetColor=Gray}But I can't be all take and no give. I need to do\nsomething for her.{SetColor=Default}
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_A: <EDH>
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_A_001: Haaah...
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_A_002: Theodora! Got some water for you.
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_A_003: Some dried cervi too. It's full of goodness. Perk you\nright up!
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_A_004: If you're tired, just take a bite and then have a\nlittle nap.
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_A_005: That is considerate of you. But you need not worry.
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_A_006: I was enjoying a short reprieve. This battle of ours\nhas worn on far longer than most conflicts.
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_A_007: The armies of the underworld... Fighting all those\ndead people... Hard to believe it's real.
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_A_008: Have you...thought much about all this, Theodora?
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_A_009: What if...someone from your family was a Brimstone\nLord, and you had to fight them?
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_A_010: Whoever my opponent, I will cut them down. Even if\nthey were a blood relative.
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_A_011: Guess that's not too surprising coming from you.
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_A_012: And you? I know that Aurora yet lives, but...
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_A_013: My pop died of his illness. But he and Mom and me\ngot to be together for a while, at least.
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_A_016: It was a happy time for our little family. I wouldn't\nwant anything to ruin the memories we made.
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_A_017: Hm.
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_A_018: I can at least march ahead of you. Then you need\nnot meet a parent as a Brimstone Lord.
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_A_019: Thank you. But there's no need for that. I can fight\nmy own fights.
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_A_020: You must not hesitate—for the Brimstone Lords will\nnot. Do not deprive me of an ally.
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_A_021: Of course not. I'll walk by your side as long as I\ncan, Theodora.
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_A_022: Even after the fighting's done, I want you to be with\nme. I want to live side-by-side with you.
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_A_023: Ah!
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_A_024: Foolish man. Do you understand the import of\nyour words?
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_A_025: I know exactly what I'm saying.
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_A_026: And the responsibility that comes with it? To be with\nme is no small thing.
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_A_027: You would be called on to risk your life for the future\nof Saramis and its people.
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_A_028: I've been watching you do just that since the day\nwe met.
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_A_029: I understand what that means, the responsibility\nthat carries.
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_A_030: Hm. So you do grasp the full weight of it.
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_A_031: I...I shall consider it. But I shall not relax my\nstandard of strength for a husband.
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_A_032: I expect nothing less. But why don't we defeat\nBalor first?
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_A_033: Our future depends on it.
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_A_034: Indeed. Fight alongside me, for now, as we work to\nsalvage this world.
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_A_035: If he is so bold to say such things to me, then he is\nas insolent as the day we met.
MID_SE_Kai_Seo_A_036: A husband, hmm? Heh.